       offset referred to the input, at the same point; its output's move from VIN+ = 12 V to 25 V, at VSENSE = 50 mV (CMR);
       its output's move from V+ = 5 V to 25 V, at VSENSE = 50 mV (PSR); R66 8.25k, 0.1 %, 25 ppm/K over 45 K, the printed
       solder-heat and life limits; the bank, 5 x WSL2512R0700FEA in parallel: 1 %, 75 ppm/K from -55 to +155 C; the bank's
