     - documented dependency: the load R65 + R66 (25.15k nominal, 24.85k to 25.46k with tolerance, drift and aging) against
       the 25 kOhm of the gain row
     - assumption: the same move at the trip's own VSENSE (45.626 to 51.365 mV): G_CM x |VSENSE - 50 mV|; U18's VIN+ input
       bias (10 uA typical, no maximum printed)
     - requirement: the input voltage at most 25 V (REQ-016)
     - parts and board E: U18 INA169NA/3K, U19 TPS3701DDCR, U20 TPS3808G33DBVR, R60 to R64 (5 x WSL2512R0700FEA), R65 16.9k,
