     A new), against the panel's highest current on SC-37's day at any hold corner, 2.8779 A: it never acts that day. One
     bank part carries at most 0.041 W at the highest trip (its rating 1 W to 70 C). CAN A CONDITIONAL TERM OVERTURN THE
